Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:14.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's finally done.\NOur new house is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.46,0:00:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looking at it now, it really is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.29,0:00:19.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Keep on digging!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:21.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're going to add a cellar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want me to keep going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need big support beams, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.63,0:00:28.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here comes the swing. Fore!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had an inkling while working\Nthat it would turn out like this, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.67,0:00:35.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And we helped out with the design.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:36.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.54,0:00:37.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:39.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We also made sure that\Nthe requests of the future residents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.13,0:00:40.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,were all addressed during construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:43.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a resident too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.67,0:00:47.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't feel right if you didn't have\Nthe nicest house here, Hiraku!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:50.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's tour the interior.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.63,0:00:57.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The structure inside looks a lot like\Nthe house you live in, Lea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.54,0:00:59.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right now we're in the main hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.58,0:01:02.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We designed it so that everyone could\Ngather here and chat or hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.75,0:01:06.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And this here is your room, Hiraku.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:10.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.63,0:01:15.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And opposite your room\Nacross the main hall is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.29,0:01:16.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the dining room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.75,0:01:21.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a kitchen in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.63,0:01:24.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We even set up more stoves outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:27.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So this is the cellar, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.13,0:01:31.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This will be great for storing\Nfood and firewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.33,0:01:36.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was hoping for my own room!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.38,0:01:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was getting crowded with\Nall the people we have now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.42,0:01:41.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks like you guys\Nreally like your rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:42.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.46,0:01:44.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So what's this room over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:48.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This one has a bolt lock for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.25,0:01:50.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why did they put one here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.29,0:01:58.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll pretend I didn't see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.58,0:02:02.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's really exciting to finally see\Nour new house like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, I love everything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.29,0:02:12.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looking up at that tree from here\Nmakes it feel like it's watching over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.79,0:02:15.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is a really great house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.63,0:02:17.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.88,0:02:21.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After you've spent the winter here, if you\Nfeel any part of the house is unsatisfactory
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.25,0:02:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,please let me know so that we may fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.29,0:02:24.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.75,0:02:26.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:33.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In addition to my God statue, I decided\Nto make some statues of my dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.08,0:02:36.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I put them in front of the entrance\Nto the new house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.25,0:02:39.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is shaping up pretty nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:03:03.17,Song,,0,0,0,,When you open your eyes and see\Nthat pure white light, the story begins
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.17,0:03:09.92,Song,,0,0,0,,Stepping forth into a new world,\Nwhat kind of flowers will we make bloom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.13,0:03:17.50,Song,,0,0,0,,Even if it's cloudy,\Neven if we get dirty from a puddle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:20.33,Song,,0,0,0,,We continue on
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:27.08,Song,,0,0,0,,There's a future we can't imagine\Nwaiting for us, I'm sure of it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:30.96,Song,,0,0,0,,Meeting, meeting, and connecting
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:34.25,Song,,0,0,0,,If you smile,\Neveryone around you will smile too
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:38.29,Song,,0,0,0,,Let's plant a small seed and nurture it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.29,0:03:42.38,Song,,0,0,0,,One day it'll become a large flower
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.38,0:03:45.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Turn regrets and failures into fuel
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.88,0:03:49.21,Song,,0,0,0,,So that you're overflowing with colorful happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.21,0:03:53.42,Song,,0,0,0,,We'll join hands and share
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:59.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Spread across the world, Flower Ring
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:19.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This looks like all the main ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:23.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, I overdid it out there\Nand now I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.63,0:04:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are we eating today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:29.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I going to try and see if I can manage to make\Na new dish we haven't tried yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:31.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Something new?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.25,0:04:32.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.29,0:04:33.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's called curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:36.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh, I've never heard of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:39.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're going to try to make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:42.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Does that mean that this curry is\Na difficult dish to make?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:46.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, it can be easy to make,\Nbut mastering the dish takes a lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.17,0:04:50.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Usually, you'd just add roux to the pot\Nand cook it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.75,0:04:51.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:54.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So that's the kind of stuff you're into?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:55.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You savage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:56.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.71,0:04:58.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.79,0:05:01.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize that you'd planted\Nall these crop fields, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:03.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've been working at it little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:06.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of plants here I don't recognize.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:07.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.71,0:05:09.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's because there are a lot of plants here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:11.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that normally can't grow in climates\Nwith any snowfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.17,0:05:12.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With the almighty farming tool,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:16.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can grow plants that are\Nreally sensitive to seasonal weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:20.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The almighty farming tool really does it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.38,0:05:24.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, lets harvest the spices\Nwe're going to need for the curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.88,0:05:26.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First up is cumin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.50,0:05:28.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a cute sounding name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.75,0:05:30.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's already dried out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:32.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After the flower has already bloomed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.46,0:05:34.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the seed that gets left behind\Nmakes for a good spice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:36.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the spice that's most responsible\Nfor curry's aroma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:41.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a peculiar smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.17,0:05:43.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next up is turmeric.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.17,0:05:46.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the main ingredient\Nthat gives curry its color.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:48.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The part we care about is the root,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.08,0:05:50.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but the part that grows\Nabove ground is pretty huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.46,0:05:52.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We dry out the part that grows\Nunderground and use that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:56.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I ended up asking the girls\Nto dry them out for me.\N{\rSubtitle-2}Dry out, dry out. Become dry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.67,0:05:57.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Dry out, dry out. Become dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.33,0:05:59.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magic really is handy.\N{\rSubtitle-2}Dry out, dry out. Become dry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.88,0:06:01.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And next is coriander.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:04.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We grind the seeds up into powder\Nand use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:08.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This one has a nice and fresh,\Nfruit-like aroma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:09.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.29,0:06:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The green leaves up top are called cilantro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:17.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These have a potent aroma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:21.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you want to eat this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.21,0:06:28.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess we like different flavors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.46,0:06:30.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.96,0:06:32.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:34.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a plant capable of\Ndriving off inferno wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:37.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think that one will be worth researching.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.17,0:06:40.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next, we have black pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:42.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And cayenne peppers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Great. These are all the spices I'll need.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.08,0:06:47.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.92,0:06:49.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.46,0:06:54.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've heard that girls think guys who make\Ntheir own curry from scratch,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.67,0:06:56.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,starting with the spices,\Nare a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.67,0:06:58.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that's really true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.08,0:07:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.25,0:07:06.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This feels pretty authentic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:08.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.63,0:07:12.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,are you my only helper, Lea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.42,0:07:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. Lu and Tia said\Nthey're busy with research.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:19.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They said something about an\Nall powerful magical protection talisman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:22.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can handle it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:24.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First, we start by heating up\Nthe rapeseed oil we extracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.21,0:07:34.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then we add in the rabbit meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:35.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.17,0:07:38.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,While that's cooking,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.46,0:07:41.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we grind up all the spices\Nexcept for the cumin into a powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.88,0:07:44.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is this enough for the meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:46.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:50.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once you've got some color on the meat,\Ntake it off the heat so it doesn't overcook.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cook the cumin in the leftover bits\Nand juices from the meat
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.88,0:07:55.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to bring out the flavor and aroma.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.92,0:07:57.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Be careful not to burn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:08:01.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's already starting to smell\Nlike curry at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:03.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow. I've never smelled\Nanything like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:10.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next, we need to focus on sautéing\Nthe finely diced onions, ginger, and garlic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:12.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sauté them without burning them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:17.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now we add the diced tomatoes,\Nand we keep on sautéing everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.25,0:08:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you like me to take over for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:23.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:25.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once it's turned into a nice paste,\Nwe can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.25,0:08:28.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Spices in. Boom! And we add salt, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:31.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cook it a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.96,0:08:34.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then we add in the meat and\Nboiled soybeans along with some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.96,0:08:36.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It already looks and smells delicious...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.21,0:08:40.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now we let it simmer\Nuntil the meat gets soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.67,0:08:44.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do we just need to wait for it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.88,0:08:47.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.17,0:08:49.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm forgetting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:54.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's naan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.54,0:08:55.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's naan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:56.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's naan! Naan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.83,0:08:58.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's naan? Naan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.54,0:09:01.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was so focused on the curry\Nthat I forgot about it completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:03.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Should I just make rice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:06.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No! I want naan with this curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.29,0:09:08.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How many portions do I need to make?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.21,0:09:10.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me, Lu, Tia...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:12.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And if I add in the elves, that makes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.79,0:09:14.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, it makes a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:17.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the same recipe as making regular bread\Nright up through the part where we let it rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.67,0:09:21.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The difference is that now we\Nroll the dough out with a rolling pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.21,0:09:22.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.67,0:09:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're going to cook it now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.67,0:09:28.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.21,0:09:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to cook it\Ninside of the stove,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:35.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I've seen people cook it using the\Noutside of a pot before, so we'll try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.04,0:09:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What an interesting plant\Nthis turned out to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.17,0:09:41.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It doesn't appear to have been poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.50,0:09:44.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's going on there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.42,0:09:47.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can smell something appetizing\Ncoming from over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:51.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And we haven't eaten yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:53.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.13,0:09:57.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here's the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.46,0:09:58.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.71,0:10:01.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This should be just about done now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.83,0:10:08.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:10.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Curry, you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.92,0:10:13.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's got a... strange color to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.83,0:10:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll need to work up a little courage\Nto try eating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:18.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't need to be so shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:21.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think it probably came out pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.83,0:10:24.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You scoop up the curry with the naan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:27.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why we made them flat like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.25,0:10:31.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.92,0:10:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is real curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.92,0:10:36.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can smell all the spices in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.38,0:10:47.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh my. This tingly spiciness\Nseems like it could become addicting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:51.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The ratio of the spices you use\Nchanges the flavor, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:53.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This will definitely be worth researching!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.17,0:10:57.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Every bite I take makes me\Nwant to eat even more of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.17,0:11:00.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that you all like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.33,0:11:03.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well it's got a pretty unique taste,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.83,0:11:07.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so if don't really like it then\Nthere's no need to force yourself to...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.67,0:11:13.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um... would you mind\Nleaving a little for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:18.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It really works!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.71,0:11:21.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, it is pretty spicy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:24.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad the customers liked it,\Nbut now I'm sold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.54,0:11:27.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This isn't the first time it's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:30.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm stuffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:32.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I definitely want to eat that again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.00,0:11:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've pretty much memorized the recipe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.33,0:11:37.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's try changing up how much of\Nthe spices we use next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.75,0:11:41.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well they all liked it,\Nso I guess that's what's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.63,0:11:47.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But still, eating just a few bites of curry\Nreally makes you hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:49.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Farming Life...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.21,0:11:50.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in Another...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:51.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,World
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.29,0:11:57.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This year's winter started to draw near.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:02.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once the snow starts to fall, we'll spend\Nmost of our days inside the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.54,0:12:05.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to finish our winter preparations\Nbefore that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.25,0:12:09.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should be alright with\Nthis much firewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.54,0:12:12.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zabuton!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.33,0:12:14.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I brought you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.38,0:12:19.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When it gets cold outside, Zabuton goes\Ninto hibernation at the top of the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.29,0:12:23.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.58,0:12:26.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I made sure to ask for extra blankets\Nfor the winter ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:28.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks, we really needed these!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.17,0:12:33.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:35.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.42,0:12:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You too. Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.54,0:12:39.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lea and the elves are going to\Nkeep working on the forge
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.50,0:12:42.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and some other projects\Nthrough the winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm having Lu and Tia\Npreserve some food for the winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.54,0:12:56.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We season the meat,\Nthen smoke it and dry it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:13:00.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kuro and the dogs won't be able to\Nhunt very well during the winter
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.63,0:13:02.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,once it starts to snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:04.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I want to stock up\Non as much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.67,0:13:08.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Hey! Give those back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:10.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I think we'll be okay as far as meat goes.\N{\rSubtitle-2}Hey! Give those back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.71,0:13:11.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I think we'll be okay as far as meat goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.25,0:13:15.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right now I'm working on\Na way to preserve vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.58,0:13:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The vegetables go into the boxes on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.04,0:13:20.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then they're covered in a sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.88,0:13:22.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And then we cover them with snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.50,0:13:25.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's called snow storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.33,0:13:27.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The bottom boxes are left empty
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.08,0:13:28.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and collect water from any snow\Nthat melts to keep the vegetables dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:31.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll try it out as soon as it snows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.17,0:13:36.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to burn you to ashes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:38.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to burn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.38,0:13:40.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm just messing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:41.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wish I could use magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.71,0:13:49.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even though I knew there was\Nno chance it would actually work,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.58,0:13:51.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,watching them use magic every day
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.29,0:13:54.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,made me feel like I needed to try it\Nfor some reason. I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.50,0:14:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ignition may be a low level spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.25,0:14:07.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but you still can't use it\Nwithout studying magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:09.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You all make it look so easy\Nthat I thought just maybe I could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I tried copying it,\Nbut naturally it didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.88,0:14:22.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The golems Tia summons are considered\Ndifficult to use even among other magic users.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.08,0:14:26.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then doesn't that mean she's pretty amazing\Nsince she can summon a bunch of them at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.00,0:14:26.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.83,0:14:27.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Good job!\N{\rSubtitle}Well yeah, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can do a lot of stuff too, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.58,0:14:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.46,0:14:35.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But still, you guys are all really amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.92,0:14:37.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to know that I can\Nrely on you all to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:41.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I've been doing is\Nsome garden work and cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.17,0:14:43.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.71,0:14:45.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the most amazing one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.54,0:14:47.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:51.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Living out here like this\Nfor as long as you have...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.58,0:14:53.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that's something not just anyone can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.13,0:14:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.83,0:14:58.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.33,0:15:01.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No one's been able to do this up until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.88,0:15:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's just you. You're the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.46,0:15:06.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:07.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.83,0:15:27.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And so, winter had arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.17,0:15:30.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The snow began piling up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.75,0:15:32.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think that should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.88,0:15:37.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We were spending more time indoors,\Nso we needing things to do for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:40.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I started with a classic, reversi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:45.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I built a chess set and a mahjong set as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.75,0:15:47.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.92,0:15:49.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Reversi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.46,0:15:50.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.83,0:15:53.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You play the game with\Nblack and white pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.17,0:15:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When you surround an opponent's piece\Non two sides with your own pieces,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.92,0:15:56.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you flip it to your color.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.33,0:15:58.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The game ends when the board\Ncompletely fills up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.25,0:16:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and whichever player has\Nthe most pieces wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.46,0:16:01.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those are the only rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:04.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a simple game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.21,0:16:06.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it really any fun to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.46,0:16:08.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How shortsighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.17,0:16:09.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the simple design
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.83,0:16:12.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that allows for complicated strategies\Nto be developed in this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.67,0:16:14.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:17.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's amazing that you realized that\Njust from hearing the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:19.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.46,0:16:22.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I challenge you to a game right now, Tia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.67,0:16:24.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:28.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After all, you and I have entered a\Ntemporary truce since we started living here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.67,0:16:31.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed. It's time we settled the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.33,0:16:33.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,L-let's try to relax and have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.13,0:16:35.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be white.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That means that Tia gets to move first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.13,0:16:38.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then I'm black!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:39.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:52.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is definitely a win for\Nthe white team...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.75,0:16:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh no, my hand slipped!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:16:59.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's the type that likes to\Nhit the reset button.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.33,0:17:01.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Tia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.13,0:17:03.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Since we don't know exactly\Nwhere the pieces were,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.63,0:17:05.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it looks like we'll need to start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.79,0:17:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.58,0:17:19.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pressing reset doesn't work against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:23.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you find it embarrassing\Nto use your magic like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:25.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not as embarrassing as
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.17,0:17:27.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,flipping the board because you think\Nyou're about to lose the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.25,0:17:30.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You haven't learned your lesson, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.04,0:17:33.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're playing best of three!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:35.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine be me. I accept your challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.92,0:17:38.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks nice and peaceful over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:46.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.38,0:17:48.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Kuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.92,0:17:52.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He understands the rules?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.96,0:17:59.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're actually playing the game right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.33,0:18:02.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At a glance, this seems cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.17,0:18:06.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I can feel a terrifying energy\Ncoming from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.29,0:18:12.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I better not challenge\Nany of them to a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.79,0:18:14.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, is your game done?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.25,0:18:16.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'm not going to lose\Nto any of the dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.92,0:18:17.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, Lu...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.92,0:18:19.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's a good idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.17,0:18:22.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's play a round.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.13,0:18:26.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As I expected, she didn't have the courage
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to press the reset button\Nwhile playing against Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.75,0:18:36.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.79,0:18:48.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even Kuro shouldn't be able to fully\Nunderstand the game of mahjong yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:49.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's far too complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.92,0:18:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This one here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.79,0:18:54.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It might seem a little childish, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.75,0:18:56.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take revenge for Lu now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.17,0:18:59.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Riichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.42,0:19:02.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then I call tsumo! No wait, I mean ron!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.17,0:19:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's ron for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.08,0:19:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At least I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.83,0:19:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Double ron?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.13,0:19:10.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, the yasume should save...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.13,0:19:11.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:13.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.13,0:19:18.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-it's the 13 orphans...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:21.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't this yakuman?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.00,0:19:24.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It seemed complicated at first,\Nbut the game is actually pretty simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.79,0:19:29.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see, Hiraku doesn't have\Nany points left, so Kuro wins the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.63,0:19:32.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kuro, you're number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.71,0:19:45.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I figured that only playing board games\Nall day wouldn't be good for our health,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:47.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I built a mini bowling set, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:49.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:52.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely not just mad\Nthat I lost at mahjong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.21,0:20:05.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Eight pins. Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.63,0:20:09.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The arsonist and the serial killer\Nare really hard to take down, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:11.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The scam artist up front is surprisingly tough, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.38,0:20:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These nasty sounding titles are ones\Nwe've given to each of the pins here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.63,0:20:18.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They were just normal pins\NI'd carved at first, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.17,0:20:20.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why do we want to knock them down?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.67,0:20:22.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lu hit me with that question,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.18,0:20:25.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I decided the best answer was\N"To take out the bad guys."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:31.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Got 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.75,0:20:33.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm up next.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:35.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it's because\Nthey enjoyed the simplicity of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.33,0:20:36.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.96,0:20:37.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but the bowling was a big hit with them.\N{\rSubtitle-2}You did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.79,0:20:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but the bowling was a big hit with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.13,0:20:46.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And so, we spent our winter all together,\Nnice and cozy inside and playing games.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.92,0:20:53.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those days went by faster\Nthan we thought they would.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:07.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The snow melted, and spring came.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.96,0:21:15.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a nice morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.13,0:21:18.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's gotten nice and warm outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.96,0:21:20.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.25,0:21:21.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:25.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.33,0:21:27.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do today?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.21,0:21:28.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.13,0:21:31.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to finish planting the crops\Nas soon as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.46,0:21:36.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think it's about time that Zabuton\Nwoke up from her hibernation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.00,0:21:38.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We still have some potatoes left, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.25,0:21:40.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, I believe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.25,0:21:48.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Based on the number of taps,\Nit should be coming from this direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.83,0:21:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Something big is headed here...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.46,0:21:58.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that... a dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.17,0:22:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, it's a wyvern!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.54,0:22:01.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.21,0:22:38.96,Song,,0,0,0,,I can feel the soft seasonal winds,\Ngently on my fingertips
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.29,0:22:47.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Let's search for what we love\Nin the clouds floating in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.88,0:22:52.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Forget about the hands of the clock for now
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.67,0:22:57.08,Song,,0,0,0,,Try taking one deep breath
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:23:06.71,Song,,0,0,0,,The rainbow-colored scenery\Nwill resonate with my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.04,0:23:13.04,Song,,0,0,0,,I'm sure any wish I have will come true
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.04,0:23:17.58,Song,,0,0,0,,Because you're by my side
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:22.17,Song,,0,0,0,,You make every day feel like a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.42,0:23:26.96,Song,,0,0,0,,At that warm and kind place
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.96,0:23:34.13,Song,,0,0,0,,Keep showing me your smiling face forever
